<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-KR SIGNS DM 5.5 MLN CONTRACTS.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-KR SIGNS DM 5.5 MLN CONTRACTS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Mostostal Krakow SA said in a Thursday statement it signed two contracts worth 5.45 million marks with the Polimex-Cekop SA industrial construction firm for construction works in Germany.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
